## Checklist

- [ ] **README.md** and **docs/** read first
- [ ] § Think done — features listed as chunks if multi-feature
- [ ] Master plan `plan/plan-[name].md` **if** non-trivial
- [ ] Feature chunks `plan/features/{slug}.md` **if** 2+ features (each with **Thinking** section)
- [ ] Implement one feature chunk at a time; update chunk status
- [ ] Subagents defined in plan and spawned **if** independent parallel work — **rule list passed in each prompt** (AGENTS.md § 3)
- [ ] `{frontend_app}` / `{backend_app}` from README — not assumed `apps/web` / `apps/api`
- [ ] Env: keys from README/docs; plan `.md` **key only** when docs empty (`Value` = `—`); `.env.example` at implement with comment if needed
- [ ] Research: context7 → web → **marketplace/MCP/skills/npm check** → codebase
- [ ] Plan § Tools & marketplace lists chosen tools or “build custom” rationale
- [ ] Coding starts only after think + plan (if needed) + subagent handoff (if needed)
